            <ArticleTitle>Relationship between meteorological changes and occurrence of painful sickle cell crises in Kuwait.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>159-61</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In a retrospective study of 282 hospital admissions for sickle cell anaemia, a definite relationship was found between the occurrence of painful crises and seasonal changes in Kuwait. The findings are discussed in relation to the literature.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
